      "baseline": null,
      "run": "module contract;\n\n// Trusted resource-projection assumptions, vocabulary version 1.\n// These preserve the Cycle 19 audit table; they do not verify the C bodies.\n// Borrowed scalar/opaque arguments carry no resource custody requirement.\n// Detailed observation/lifecycle contracts remain separate semantic profiles.\n\nextern fn malloc(size: usize) -> ptr<mut, u8>\ncontract {\n    requires resource_contract_v1;\n    ensures normal resource_borrowed(size);\n    ensures normal resource_return_owned(nullable);\n};\n\nextern fn calloc(count: usize, size: usize) -> ptr<mut, u8>\ncontract {\n    requires resource_contract_v1;\n    ensures normal resource_borrowed(count);\n    ensures normal resource_borrowed(size);\n    ensures normal resource_return_owned(nullable);\n};\n\nextern fn free(ptr: ptr<mut, u8>) -> unit\ncontract {\n    requires resource_contract_v1;\n    ensures normal resource_released(ptr, nullable);\n    ensures normal resource_return_none();\n};\n"
